    {
      "id": "raw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## ① 原始来源 · 保持只读\n\n官方 Export*.json / Plus Export*.json\nWFCD 分类与 i18n / Oracle 清单\nlibrary.mjs → 文件清单与哈希",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "inputs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 165,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## ② 识别结构与完整 ID\n\nfull-inputs.mjs\nmap / array / group 分类\n字典单独索引；reference 留原结构",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "rules",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## 规则 JSON · 决定怎么处理\n\nmerge-full-contract.json\ncatalogs / fields / priority / nested\nmerge-overrides.json · 带哈希的人工修订",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "nested",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 455,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## 深层字段与关系\n\nnested.mjs / text-localization.mjs\n对象逐字段；有 ID 数组按身份\n无 ID 数组保留整组候选",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "merge",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 455,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## ③ 合并引擎\n\nbuild.mjs → full-build.mjs\n选择字段、解析语言、生成关系\n冲突与缺失保留可复核状态",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "proof",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 455,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## 与结果一起保存证据\n\nreports/provenance.json\n原文件 + hash + JSON Pointer\nissues / coverage / source-records",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "output",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## ④ 校验后切换当前版本\n\nrepository.mjs：暂存 → 逐文件哈希 → current\nitems/*.json · recipes · relations · rewards\nlocalizations · images · manifest.json",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ui",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## ⑤ 不同界面按需读取\n\nservice.mjs → 合并汇总 / 来源回查\nplayer-bundle.mjs → 预构建资料库\n世界状态 / 掉落表复用实体与图片",
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
